msgstr "Näytä BigLace"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/tray/linux.rs:101
#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/tray/windows.rs:82
